 version. Pay only if the HD video justifies it.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>I-IF</strong></td><td>Ideal</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/10272721?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$928</a></td><td>IF clarity is wasted at 0.5ct but inventory is thin, so this slot is cheap.</td></tr></tbody></table>

