## 0.5 Carat Marquise Lab-Grown — Live Market Inventory

Lab-grown 0.5ct marquise has thin inventory. 0.5ct is cheap enough that most lab buyers scale up to 1ct or 1.5ct for a fraction of natural pricing. Only two stones sit in the certified market at this size right now — one of them a Blue Nile listing we checked this morning.

