**Verdict:** The 0.5ct Setting Multiplier is why the stone budget should sit at 25–40% of the total ring budget, not the 60% most buyers default to. Spend $800–$1,200 on the stone. Spend the rest on the setting. The halo does more work than any clarity upgrade.

