ess clarity bragging rights</strong></td><td>GIA 0.5ct D-IF Ideal</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/28594875?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$1,958</a></td><td>The ceiling. Pay only if the Flawless cert matters to you.</td></tr><tr class="highlight-row"><td><strong>Max lab spec</strong></td><td>IGI 0.5ct D-IF VG</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/29703827?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$1,178</a></td><td>Lab D-IF for 40% less than natural D-IF. Smart max-spec play.</td></tr></tbody></table>

